        "TileImage": "$($repository de0d2376-2887-4eeb-a5fb-e48d21ee04ae).Image",
        "Description": "Listen closely 47, the Delgado drug cartel is back. Our client, politician Charles Blake III, wants us to get rid of the cartel once and for all.\r\rYour primary target goes under the codename of &quot;Mishoo&quot; and will be hanging out in the club area, so expect a lot of security.\r\rZiegler and Kaufman can be found alone near the club entrance.\r\rAlso remember that our clients want you to overdose your targets with their own drugs, giving them a taste of their own &quot;medicine&quot;.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
